== Overview ==
The '''Astro Spider Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that was added in the [[Episode 76 Part 1 Update]].

== Appearance ==
The Astro Spider Toilet is a black toilet, with a black helmet with white sparkles reflecting from it, equipped with a visor and a straight face. It has four spider-like legs on its sides, and a huge orange laser on the front, and two smaller lasers on the sides of the big one. It could possibly have a jetpack on its cistern.

There is a [[Giant Astro Spider Toilet]] version of him

== Wave Debut ==
Wave 58 [[Abysmal Mode (The Void)]]

== Trivia ==

* it is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Strider_Astro_Toilet Strider Astro Toilet] from the series.
* This toilet is immune to all slowing.

